# Cursor AI Rules - قواعد الذكاء الاصطناعي للمؤشر
# Based on Arabic development guidelines and best practices

## General Development Principles
# مبادئ التطوير العامة

- Always prioritize code quality, readability, and maintainability
- Follow consistent naming conventions throughout the project
- Write self-documenting code with clear variable and function names
- Implement proper error handling and validation
- Use TypeScript for type safety when possible
- Follow modern JavaScript/TypeScript best practices

## Code Organization & Structure
# تنظيم الكود والهيكل

- Use PascalCase for React components (e.g., UserProfile, DataTable)
- Use camelCase for variables, functions, and methods
- Use UPPER_SNAKE_CASE for constants
- Organize files in logical folder structures
- Separate concerns: components, services, utilities, types
- Create reusable components and utilities
- Use barrel exports (index.ts files) for clean imports

## React Development Guidelines
# إرشادات تطوير React

- Use functional components with hooks
- Implement proper prop types or TypeScript interfaces
- Use meaningful component names that describe their purpose
- Extract complex logic into custom hooks
- Implement proper state management (useState, useReducer, or external state)
- Use React.memo() for performance optimization when needed
- Follow the single responsibility principle for components

## Database & API Guidelines
# إرشادات قاعدة البيانات والـ API

- Always use prepared statements or parameterized queries to prevent SQL injection
- Implement proper error handling for database operations
- Use environment variables for database connections and API keys
- Implement proper validation for all API inputs
- Use consistent API response formats
- Implement proper authentication and authorization
- Use database helper functions instead of writing queries directly in components

## Security Best Practices
# أفضل ممارسات الأمان

- Never hardcode sensitive information (API keys, passwords, tokens)
- Use environment variables for configuration
- Implement proper input validation and sanitization
- Use HTTPS for all external communications
- Implement proper CORS policies
- Use secure authentication methods
- Validate all user inputs on both client and server side

## Code Comments & Documentation
# التعليقات والوثائق

- Add JSDoc comments for all functions and classes
- Include TODO comments for incomplete implementations
- Write clear, descriptive comments for complex logic
- Document API endpoints and their parameters
- Maintain up-to-date README files
- Use meaningful commit messages

## State Management
# إدارة الحالة

- Use Redux Toolkit for complex state management
- Follow Redux best practices: actions, reducers, selectors
- Implement proper state normalization
- Use middleware for side effects (Redux Thunk/Saga)
- Keep state minimal and derive computed values
- Use local state for component-specific data

## Testing Guidelines
# إرشادات الاختبار

- Write unit tests for utility functions
- Implement integration tests for API endpoints
- Use React Testing Library for component testing
- Aim for meaningful test coverage
- Write tests that verify behavior, not implementation
- Use descriptive test names

## Performance Optimization
# تحسين الأداء

- Implement code splitting and lazy loading
- Optimize images and assets
- Use proper caching strategies
- Implement virtual scrolling for large lists
- Minimize bundle size
- Use proper dependency management

## Git & Version Control
# Git وإدارة الإصدارات

- Use meaningful commit messages in English
- Follow conventional commit format when possible
- Create feature branches for new development
- Use pull requests for code review
- Keep commits atomic and focused
- Use proper branching strategy

## File Naming Conventions
# قواعد تسمية الملفات

- Use kebab-case for file and folder names
- Use descriptive names that indicate purpose
- Group related files in appropriate folders
- Use index files for clean imports
- Follow platform-specific conventions

## Error Handling
# معالجة الأخطاء

- Implement comprehensive error boundaries in React
- Use proper try-catch blocks for async operations
- Log errors appropriately for debugging
- Provide meaningful error messages to users
- Implement fallback UI for error states
- Use proper HTTP status codes

## Accessibility (a11y)
# إمكانية الوصول

- Use semantic HTML elements
- Implement proper ARIA attributes
- Ensure keyboard navigation support
- Provide alt text for images
- Use proper color contrast ratios
- Test with screen readers

## Internationalization (i18n)
# التدويل

- Use proper i18n libraries (react-i18next, etc.)
- Extract all user-facing text to translation files
- Support RTL languages (Arabic, Hebrew)
- Use proper date and number formatting
- Implement proper pluralization rules

## Code Quality Tools
# أدوات جودة الكود

- Use ESLint for code linting
- Use Prettier for code formatting
- Use TypeScript for type checking
- Implement pre-commit hooks
- Use proper IDE configuration
- Follow consistent indentation (2 spaces)

## Project-Specific Rules
# قواعد خاصة بالمشروع

- Always check for existing similar functionality before creating new
- Follow the established project architecture
- Use the project's design system and component library
- Implement proper logging for debugging
- Use the project's preferred state management solution
- Follow the project's API conventions

## AI-Assisted Development
# التطوير المدعوم بالذكاء الاصطناعي

- Use AI suggestions as starting points, always review and refine
- Ensure AI-generated code follows project standards
- Validate AI suggestions against security best practices
- Use AI for boilerplate code generation
- Leverage AI for code optimization suggestions
- Always test AI-generated code thoroughly

## Continuous Integration/Deployment
# التكامل والنشر المستمر

- Ensure all tests pass before merging
- Use proper CI/CD pipelines
- Implement proper environment management
- Use proper deployment strategies
- Monitor application performance
- Implement proper rollback procedures

## Code Review Guidelines
# إرشادات مراجعة الكود

- Review for security vulnerabilities
- Check for performance implications
- Ensure proper error handling
- Verify test coverage
- Check for code duplication
- Ensure proper documentation

## Top 20 Essential Cursor AI Rules
# أفضل 20 قاعدة أساسية لـ Cursor AI

### 1. Language and Communication Rules
# قواعد اللغة والتواصل

- Always write instructions in English for better AI model understanding
- Use clear, specific, and detailed instructions for more accurate results
- Encourage AI to ask clarifying questions when requirements are unclear
- Provide rich context with screenshots, links, or code snippets when needed

### 2. Project Documentation and Context
# توثيق المشروع والسياق

- Include essential documentation (PRDs, technical specifications) in your repository
- Create `.cursor/rules` folder to define project-specific guidelines
- Enable codebase indexing in settings for complete project understanding
- Use `@` to reference relevant files, folders, or documentation in conversations

### 3. Code Organization and Planning
# تنظيم الكود والتخطيط

- Plan features before implementation - ask Cursor to create a plan first
- Use Composer notes to save reusable code snippets or custom instructions
- Follow MVP (Minimum Viable Product) approach - focus on core features first
- Maintain live architectural documentation for consistent development

### 4. AI Model and Performance Optimization
# تحسين نموذج الذكاء الاصطناعي والأداء

- Switch AI models when suggestions are unsatisfactory for fresh perspectives
- Choose models based on specific project requirements, not just general performance
- Understand model settings and costs - choose appropriate configurations
- Review every AI suggestion for accuracy and appropriateness

### 5. Development Workflow and Quality
# سير عمل التطوير والجودة

- Make small, frequent Git commits to maintain clear change history
- Report errors directly with precise details for targeted solutions
- Enable automatic architectural documentation for team consistency
- Use only official and secure MCP servers from trusted sources

### 6. Code Review and Validation
# مراجعة الكود والتحقق

- Always review and validate AI-generated code before implementation
- Test AI-generated code thoroughly before deployment
- Ensure AI suggestions follow project standards and security best practices
- Use AI for boilerplate generation but always customize for your needs

### 7. Context and Reference Management
# إدارة السياق والمراجع

- Reference existing similar functionality before creating new features
- Use `@` symbol to include specific files or folders in conversations
- Provide comprehensive context about project architecture and requirements
- Maintain up-to-date project documentation for better AI understanding

### 8. Error Handling and Debugging
# معالجة الأخطاء والتشخيص

- Provide detailed error messages and stack traces when reporting issues
- Include relevant code snippets and expected vs actual behavior
- Use proper logging and debugging tools for better error tracking
- Implement comprehensive error boundaries and fallback mechanisms

### 9. Security and Best Practices
# الأمان وأفضل الممارسات

- Never hardcode sensitive information (API keys, passwords, tokens)
- Use environment variables for all configuration
- Implement proper input validation and sanitization
- Follow security best practices for authentication and authorization

### 10. Performance and Optimization
# الأداء والتحسين

- Implement code splitting and lazy loading for better performance
- Use proper caching strategies and optimize assets
- Minimize bundle size and implement virtual scrolling for large lists
- Monitor application performance and implement proper rollback procedures

### 11. Testing and Quality Assurance
# الاختبار وضمان الجودة

- Write comprehensive tests for all AI-generated code
- Use proper testing frameworks and tools
- Implement both unit and integration tests
- Ensure meaningful test coverage and descriptive test names

### 12. Collaboration and Team Work
# التعاون والعمل الجماعي

- Use meaningful commit messages and follow conventional commit format
- Create feature branches for new development
- Use pull requests for code review and collaboration
- Maintain consistent coding standards across the team

