## Advanced Cursor AI Rules from Expert Developers
# قواعد متقدمة لـ Cursor AI من المطورين الخبراء

### 21. Prompt Engineering Excellence
# التميز في هندسة الأوامر

- Use specific, detailed prompts instead of vague requests
- Include context about the problem domain and constraints
- Specify the expected output format and structure
- Use examples in prompts to guide AI understanding
- Break complex tasks into smaller, manageable sub-tasks

### 22. Strategic Logging and Debugging
# التسجيل الاستراتيجي والتشخيص

- Implement strategic console.log statements for debugging
- Use structured logging with timestamps and context
- Create debug modes that can be toggled in production
- Log important state changes and user interactions
- Use proper log levels (debug, info, warn, error)

### 23. Test-Driven Development (TDD) Integration
# تكامل التطوير الموجه بالاختبارات

- Always request unit tests before implementing new features
- Write tests that verify behavior, not implementation details
- Use descriptive test names that explain the expected behavior
- Implement both positive and negative test cases
- Maintain high test coverage for critical business logic

### 24. Performance Monitoring and Optimization
# مراقبة الأداء والتحسين

- Set clear performance benchmarks and monitoring
- Implement performance budgets for bundle size and load times
- Use performance profiling tools to identify bottlenecks
- Monitor Core Web Vitals and user experience metrics
- Implement lazy loading and code splitting strategies

### 25. Advanced Git Workflow Integration
# تكامل متقدم لسير عمل Git

- Use conventional commit messages with scope and type
- Create feature branches with descriptive names
- Implement proper branch protection rules
- Use Git hooks for automated quality checks
- Maintain clean commit history with proper squashing

### 26. Context-Aware Development
# التطوير الواعي بالسياق

- Always provide relevant file context using @ symbol
- Include related documentation and specifications
- Reference existing similar implementations
- Provide business context and user stories
- Include design mockups and wireframes when available

### 27. Error Recovery and Resilience
# استعادة الأخطاء والمرونة

- Implement comprehensive error boundaries
- Create fallback UI components for error states
- Use retry mechanisms for failed API calls
- Implement graceful degradation for non-critical features
- Provide meaningful error messages to users

### 28. Code Generation Quality Control
# مراقبة جودة توليد الكود

- Always review AI-generated code line by line
- Validate security implications of generated code
- Check for potential performance issues
- Ensure code follows project-specific patterns
- Test all generated code thoroughly before deployment

### 29. Documentation-Driven Development
# التطوير الموجه بالتوثيق

- Write documentation before implementing features
- Use JSDoc comments for all public APIs
- Maintain up-to-date README files
- Document architectural decisions and trade-offs
- Create user guides and API documentation

### 30. Multi-Model AI Strategy
# استراتيجية الذكاء الاصطناعي متعدد النماذج

- Switch between different AI models for different tasks
- Use specialized models for specific domains (code, documentation, testing)
- Compare outputs from different models for critical decisions
- Understand the strengths and limitations of each model
- Use the most appropriate model for each specific task

### 31. Iterative Development Approach
# نهج التطوير التكراري

- Start with MVP and iterate based on feedback
- Use AI to generate multiple solution approaches
- Implement rapid prototyping with AI assistance
- Gather user feedback early and often
- Continuously improve based on real-world usage

### 32. Advanced Security Practices
# ممارسات أمان متقدمة

- Implement Content Security Policy (CSP) headers
- Use proper CORS configuration for API endpoints
- Implement rate limiting and DDoS protection
- Use secure session management and token handling
- Regular security audits and vulnerability scanning

### 33. Accessibility-First Development
# التطوير الموجه بإمكانية الوصول أولاً

- Implement ARIA attributes from the start
- Test with screen readers and keyboard navigation
- Ensure proper color contrast ratios
- Provide alternative text for all images
- Support multiple input methods (keyboard, mouse, touch)

### 34. Internationalization Best Practices
# أفضل ممارسات التدويل

- Extract all user-facing strings to translation files
- Support RTL languages (Arabic, Hebrew) properly
- Use proper date, time, and number formatting
- Implement proper pluralization rules
- Test with different languages and locales

### 35. Advanced State Management Patterns
# أنماط متقدمة لإدارة الحالة

- Use proper state normalization techniques
- Implement optimistic updates for better UX
- Use middleware for complex side effects
- Implement proper state persistence strategies
- Use state machines for complex workflows

### 36. API Design Excellence
# التميز في تصميم الـ API

- Design RESTful APIs with proper HTTP methods
- Implement proper API versioning strategies
- Use consistent response formats and error codes
- Implement proper API documentation with examples
- Use API testing tools and contract testing

### 37. Database Optimization Strategies
# استراتيجيات تحسين قاعدة البيانات

- Use proper indexing strategies for query optimization
- Implement database connection pooling
- Use prepared statements for all queries
- Implement proper database migration strategies
- Monitor and optimize slow queries

### 38. Advanced Testing Strategies
# استراتيجيات اختبار متقدمة

- Implement integration tests for critical user flows
- Use end-to-end testing for complete user journeys
- Implement visual regression testing
- Use property-based testing for complex algorithms
- Implement performance testing for critical paths

### 39. Deployment and DevOps Excellence
# التميز في النشر وعمليات التطوير

- Use proper environment management (dev, staging, prod)
- Implement blue-green or canary deployments
- Use proper monitoring and alerting systems
- Implement proper rollback procedures
- Use infrastructure as code (IaC) practices

### 40. Continuous Learning and Adaptation
# التعلم المستمر والتكيف

- Stay updated with latest Cursor AI features and capabilities
- Regularly review and update your rules based on experience
- Learn from AI suggestions and improve your prompts
- Share knowledge and best practices with your team
- Experiment with new AI tools and techniques

Remember: These rules are guidelines to improve code quality, maintainability, and development efficiency. Always adapt them to your specific project requirements while maintaining consistency and best practices.
